            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carolyn Stas"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a really great quick salad. \nI didn’t cook the onions but instead I reduced the quantity and chopped in little bits. Also instead of using straight balsamic, I mixed balsamic, lemon juice and little agave nectar but you could use honey too.\nIt was a hit at my party",
            "datePublished": "2020-07-05T16:32:11.037Z"
          },
